Exp Z'·2: Enhanced Lemma — ℓ-rank obstruction for p ≢ 0,-1 mod ℓ
========================================================================

ENHANCED LEMMA PROOF:
  p ≡ r mod ℓ,  r ≠ 0, ℓ-1.
  ℓ | #E ⟹ t ≡ r+1 mod ℓ.
  #E^t ≡ 2(r+1) mod ℓ.
  ℓ | 2(r+1) iff ℓ | r+1 iff r = ℓ-1.  Excluded. ⟹ ℓ ∤ #E^t.  ∎

