SUMMARY
========================================================================

  Old Lemma: p ≡ 1 mod ℓ  ⟹  (ℓ|#E ⟹ ℓ∤#E^t)
  New Lemma: p ≢ 0,ℓ-1 mod ℓ ⟹  (ℓ|#E ⟹ ℓ∤#E^t)

  Coverage improvement:
    Old: covers (ℓ-2)/(ℓ-1) residue classes  (only r=1 for ℓ=3!)
